From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:24:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat: Confirm event presence with the check-in code

Enrolled participants send the event check-in code to POST /events/{id}/checkin. Enrollment::confirm() compares it with the event checkin_code and stores confirmed_at (new nullable column in event_user); a wrong or malformed code gets a generic error. The admin show page displays confirmed/enrolled.
